    /plan2: never draw the draft with a question unanswered (#626)

    * Spec 17.5: the draft is never shown with a question unanswered

    Refs #625

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KMYi1L5cdxKposndycu6gn

    * /plan2: never draw the draft with a question unanswered

    Reopening a question from its sticker, leaving it half-answered (one day
    of a new date range) and hopping to another sticker could reach the draft
    with no end date: an empty calendar, "-1 nights". The draft now routes
    back to the first unanswered question; a behavior case drives the hop.
    The stay sticker also drops a leading "The" so it names the place.

    Closes #625

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KMYi1L5cdxKposndycu6gn

    * Converge the README pack badges after the barriers pack retired

    Regenerated by the engine's convergeWiring, not by hand; the dangling
    badge was blocking the world sweep on main.

    Refs #625

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KMYi1L5cdxKposndycu6gn

    ---------

    Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

